{"2180890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bunny Game", "steam_appid": 2180890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD THE GAME TO YOUR WISHLIST TO KNOW WHEN IT GETS A DISCOUNT!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/30167d0c62243e986793e69568bc41b1.poster.avif?t=1787132873\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/30167d0c62243e986793e69568bc41b1.webm?t=1787132873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>A merciless multiplayer survival challenge. Trust is fragile when betrayal lurks in every shadow.</strong> Dive into a world where alliances are as unstable as the harsh conditions you face. Will you outwit your friends and survive the impending doom?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/8d4d1c1560f5427c8f5f5bd16574638e.avif?t=1787132873\" width=616 height=73 /></span><br><br>Experience the thrill and treachery in <strong>12-player multiplayer mode</strong>, online or over LAN. Work together to complete quests and outlast the winter, but more importantly, can you see through the deception among your allies?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Diverse strategies, unique mechanics:</strong> Each game unfolds differently. Will you be a cunning saboteur or a dedicated gatherer?<br></li><li><strong>Work together to overcome obstacles and gather resources.</strong> The locals don't take kindly to carrot-stealing visitors, but you’ll need snacks to make it through winter.<br></li><li><strong>Stealth and strategy:</strong> Utilize the terrain to your advantage against the dangerous environment. Navigate in between hiding spots and dense underbrush while keeping an eye on your companions – are they really helping?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/60401ceb443a9d910ffdab2c2c8e036a.poster.avif?t=1787132873\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/60401ceb443a9d910ffdab2c2c8e036a.webm?t=1787132873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/71d839552d4f0dba97069a0bf742375b.avif?t=1787132873\" width=616 height=73 /></span><br><br><strong>You'll need to work together if you want to survive past winter.</strong> Dynamic time and weather systems make exploration dangerous and unpredictable. Be mindful not to get stranded alone in the cold!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Prepare and survive against <strong>dangerous weather changes!</strong><br></li><li>Mind the time and <strong>don't get lost at night!</strong><br></li><li>Cold slows you down and makes you vulnerable, so <strong>stay warm!</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/2aeef22a9f69bc5e26ccf30d65573edf.poster.avif?t=1787132873\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/2aeef22a9f69bc5e26ccf30d65573edf.webm?t=1787132873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/42160e1e0ae78fbbf8369634597907db.avif?t=1787132873\" width=616 height=73 /></span><br><br><strong>Prepare for the unpredictable in the safety of your burrow.</strong> Unlock new maps and upgrades while you wait for your friends to get ready to play.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Relax and get ready</strong> in your home burrow while waiting for the rest of your friends to join.<br></li><li><strong>Get upgraded!</strong> Spend the resources you gathered to unlock tools and upgrades which will make your job easier.<br></li><li><strong>Unlock new maps and areas</strong> for you and your friends to explore.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/a536faa2907a7d0785e63a2935f63def.poster.avif?t=1787132873\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/a536faa2907a7d0785e63a2935f63def.webm?t=1787132873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/2e71901a617ae4671c4d54cea938435a.poster.avif?t=1787132873\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/2e71901a617ae4671c4d54cea938435a.webm?t=1787132873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<strong>A merciless multiplayer survival challenge. Trust is fragile when betrayal lurks in every shadow.</strong> Dive into a world where alliances are as unstable as the harsh conditions you face. Will you outwit your friends and survive the impending doom?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180890/extras/8d4d1c1560f5427c8f5f5